\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Displacement accumulated in the EV RSS over three cycles, starting from an intrusion at $t=0$ that follows an infinite periodic history. Displacement is normalised by $b$, distance by $aT$ and time by $T$. (a)~Profiles every $T/4$; thick lines mark the end of each cycle, when both flanks have moved uniformly by $b/2$ per cycle. (b)~Displacement histories at fixed distances from the axis ($x>0$), from the staircase at $x=0^+$ to the near-uniform rate at $x=3\,aT$; the dotted line marks the mean rate $(b/2)\,t/T$.}}{7}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
