\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {15}{\ignorespaces EV RSS velocity profile under stochastic recurrence ($a = T = b = 1$; phase $\tau /T = 0.5$; 300 past intrusions; 500 realisations; $T = b/V$ on average in every case). Velocity is normalised by $b/T$ and distance by $aT$. Shaded bands show the 10th--90th percentile range; coloured lines are ensemble medians; the black dashed line is the deterministic RSS (\ref {eq:vcss}); vertical dashed lines mark $\xi = \pm 1$. (a)~Contrast: openings $b_j$ random ($c_v = 0.30$) with $T$ fixed. (b)~Intervals $T_j$ random ($c_v = 0.30$) with each opening coupled to the preceding interval, $b_j = V T_j$. (c)~Dike position $x_j$ random, Normal with $\sigma _x = 0.1\,aT$, periodic timing and opening. (d)~Cases (b) and (c) combined. Insets in (c) and (d) enlarge $|\xi | \le 0.5$. In all four cases the ensemble median stays within 3 per cent of $V/2$ of the deterministic RSS.}}{19}{figure.15}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:stochastic_css}{{15}{19}{EV RSS velocity profile under stochastic recurrence ($a = T = b = 1$; phase $\tau /T = 0.5$; 300 past intrusions; 500 realisations; $T = b/V$ on average in every case). Velocity is normalised by $b/T$ and distance by $aT$. Shaded bands show the 10th--90th percentile range; coloured lines are ensemble medians; the black dashed line is the deterministic RSS (\ref {eq:vcss}); vertical dashed lines mark $\xi = \pm 1$. (a)~Contrast: openings $b_j$ random ($c_v = 0.30$) with $T$ fixed. (b)~Intervals $T_j$ random ($c_v = 0.30$) with each opening coupled to the preceding interval, $b_j = V T_j$. (c)~Dike position $x_j$ random, Normal with $\sigma _x = 0.1\,aT$, periodic timing and opening. (d)~Cases (b) and (c) combined. Insets in (c) and (d) enlarge $|\xi | \le 0.5$. In all four cases the ensemble median stays within 3 per cent of $V/2$ of the deterministic RSS}{figure.15}{}}
